  |title The stunning frequency of things unquestioned once actionable

  |quote
    OK, this is very encouraging, and yes, it's the stunning frequency of things unquestioned once "actionable" that is the general symptom in all of its manifestations.

  |occasion
    After the agent ran three self-probes for the first time and got three hits
    inside a minute.

  |about
    The general symptom under every manifestation: a premise stops being a question
    the moment an action needs it.

  |should-come-to-mind-when
    - You just formed a plan — name what it presupposes.
    - You are about to proceed on something unchecked because checking would delay you.

  |see
    #ver-discount-is-unquestioning
